**Theorems A, A′, B, C and E.**

| Claim | Verdict | Referee assessment |
|---|---|---|
| §3.1(i), degree one with two terms | **CORRECT** | With fixed denominator \(C_dM^2\), \(\|b\|_\infty\asymp PH/M^2\); progression spacing cancels \(M\). |
