   103	The whole-range window is therefore g ∈ [⌈(F_lo−c)/M²⌉, ⌊(F_hi−c)/M²⌋]. Its width is
   104	W ≤ (F_hi − F_lo)/M² + 1 = O(H√N/M² + 1), with H = max(A,B).
