   138	
   139	- **Cost.** m + Σ_τ ⌈W_τ/m⌉, cycloharvey's counting.
   140	- **λ.** Each (v, M) has ρ_v(M) ∈ {0, 2} targets, and covers a fraction ρ/M of the
   141	  candidates. Write λ = Σ ρ_v(M)/M for the expected cover multiplicity.
