   117	\[
   118	\frac{Y}{H^2}
   119	\asymp X^{(1-7\varepsilon)/6}n^{-7/3}\longrightarrow\infty.
   120	\]
   121	The allowed \(\varepsilon<1/10\) is safely within the necessary \(\varepsilon<1/7\).
