   129	Since \(M\nmid N\), cancellation of \(p\) modulo \(M\) is legitimate. Hence
   130	\[
   131	p\bmod M\text{ is a selected root}
   132	\iff M\mid Bp-Aq.
   133	\]
   134	The whole-range window then contains the integral value
   135	\[
   136	g=\frac{Bp+Aq-c}{M^2}.
   137	\]
