   202	det[(i)_k]_{k=1..K, i∈I} = ∏_{i∈I} i · ∏_{i<i'}(i'−i) ≠ 0 for 0 ∉ I.
   203	
   204	*Proof.* (i)_k is a monic degree-k polynomial in i with zero constant term. Row
   205	reduction gives det[i^k]_{k=1..K}, which is ∏i times a Vandermonde.
