   208	(G'(t), …, G^{(K)}(t)) = M(t)·b with M(t) invertible, so Σ_{k≤K}|G^{(k)}(t)| ≥ c_I‖b‖_∞.
   209	
   210	**Lemma C (coverage, proved).** Let G = Σ_{k∈I} b_k t^k, |I| = K, and t ∈ J =
   211	[c^{−1/2}, 1]. For any measurable E ⊂ ℝ,
   212	
   213	  |{t ∈ J : G(t) ∈ E}| ≤ C_I·(|E|/‖b‖_∞)^{1/K}.
